world  catapult into a raised bucket

floor

catapult
  is a          catapult
  pivot height  40 cm
  arm length    1 m
  arm mass      300 g
  swings        from 0° to 55°
  spring        3 N·m/rad toward 150°
  damping       0.05 N·m·s/rad

ball
  is a      sphere 6 cm radius, 150 g
  rolls
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  moves     freely
  sits      in catapult

target
  is a          raised bucket
  table height  50 cm
  size          80 cm
  walls         30 cm
  stands        on floor, 2.6 m beyond ball

expect
  ball comes to rest in target
